#: ../../whatsnew/2.5.rst:745
msgid ""
"The new :mod:`contextlib` module provides some functions and a decorator "
"that are useful for writing objects for use with the ':keyword:`with`' "
"statement."
msgstr ""

#: ../../whatsnew/2.5.rst:748
msgid ""
"The decorator is called :deco:`~contextlib.contextmanager`, and lets you "
"write a single generator function instead of defining a new class.  The "
"generator should yield exactly one value.  The code up to the :keyword:"
"`yield` will be executed as the :meth:`~object.__enter__` method, and the "
"value yielded will be the method's return value that will get bound to the "
"variable in the ':keyword:`with`' statement's :keyword:`!as` clause, if "
"any.  The code after the :keyword:`yield` will be executed in the :meth:"
"`~object.__exit__` method.  Any exception raised in the block will be raised "
"by the :keyword:`!yield` statement."
msgstr ""
"這個裝飾器叫做 :deco:`~contextlib.contextmanager`，讓你只需要撰寫一個產生器函"
"式，而不必定義一個新類別。該產生器應該恰好 yield 一個值。直到 :keyword:"
"`yield` 之前的程式碼會被當作 :meth:`~object.__enter__` 方法執行，而 yield 出"
"來的值會成為該方法的回傳值，並在有指定的情況下被繫結到「\\ :keyword:"
"`with`\\ 」陳述式 :keyword:`!as` 子句中的變數。:keyword:`yield` 之後的程式碼"
"則會在 :meth:`~object.__exit__` 方法中執行。區塊中引發的任何例外都會由 :"
"keyword:`!yield` 陳述式重新引發。"

